# What the render writes and the deploy uploads. Reproduced by `bun run render`.
out/

# The renderer checkout, when it is fetched here rather than pointed at.
.renderer/

# Map tiles already fetched on this machine. Derived data, like everything in out/ — the published
# bucket is the real store, and this only keeps a local render from asking Kartverket again.
.tiles/

# Local credentials and addresses. See .env.example; nothing here is committed.
.env
